& [SourceShape] is deliberately split
  + [facade] is workspace_admission.rs with public strict forms, the fixed observation plan, reconciliation flow, receipt formation, and freshness API
  + [validation] is workspace_admission/validation.rs with request, path, branch, object, executable, digest, and canonical-output validation
  + [process] is workspace_admission/process.rs with exact direct child launch, sensitive Git-environment removal, bounded concurrent drain, monotonic timeout, and exact-child cleanup
  + [inventory] is workspace_admission/inventory.rs with strict NUL-delimited worktree parsing and exact candidate reconciliation
  + [tests] is workspace_admission/tests.rs with focused adversarial fixtures
  + [operator] is examples/candidate_workspace_probe.rs with a bounded absolute input and JSON stdout

& [ImplementedFlow] is closed
  + [step_1] strictly decode and validate complete request data
  + [step_2] prove exact canonical nonsymlink roots and hash-pinned Git executable
  + [step_3] execute twelve fixed read-only Git observations without a shell
  + [step_4] account process and byte limits before accepting each result
  + [step_5] reconcile repository, linked-worktree, branch, base, inventory, clean status, and no-submodule facts
  + [step_6] form request, observation, and self-excluding receipt SHA-256 identities
  + [step_7] require exact receipt equality on immediate revalidation

